,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468132907,"data":"       | analysisFor n=5, O_c is None again. So maybe my circumcenter function fails due to collinearity? But earlier we got ratio for n=5 using earlier method (cyclic_ratio_for_c) which used sympy's Circle constructor to compute O_c. That succeeded. So my numpy method maybe fails due to floating precision causing near collinearity. Let's use sympy's Circle to compute circumcenter robustly.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468134791,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468135988,"data":"       | Let's revert to earlier approach using sympy's geometry Circle (which succeeded). We'll compute ratio using sympy for moderate n (up to maybe 12). The earlier function cyclic_ratio_for_c used sympy geometry for O_c and succeeded for n=5. Let's use that.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468137659,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468138809,"data":"       | But we need to compute ratio for larger n (like up to 30) to see limit. Sympy may handle large numbers but may be slower. However we can compute using rational arithmetic maybe.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468140317,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468141455,"data":"       | But we can also attempt to derive analytic expression for ratio using Fibonacci numbers.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468142816,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468143943,"data":"       | Given pattern for c, we can attempt to compute ratio symbolically in terms of n.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468145273,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468146732,"data":"       | But maybe easier: compute ratio for n up to, say, 30 using high-precision floats and using a robust circumcenter method that handles near collinearity. The near collinearity occurs because K, K', B become nearly collinear for large n? Actually O_c becomes large radius, but not collinear. However numeric issues may cause near zero denominator.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468148573,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468149688,"data":"       | We can compute O_c using formula for circumcenter of three points using linear algebra solving for intersection of perpendicular bisectors, which may be unstable. But we can compute O_c by solving system:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468151276,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468152395,"data":"       | Let points B (0,0), K (x1,y1), K' (x2,y2). The circumcenter (h,k) satisfies:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468153721,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468154825,"data":"       | h^2 + k^2 = (h - x1)^2 + (k - y1)^2 = (h - x2)^2 + (k - y2)^2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468156153,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468157288,"data":"       | Subtract first two equations:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468158551,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468159675,"data":"       | h^2 + k^2 - [(h - x1)^2 + (k - y1)^2] = 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468160898,"data":"       | =\u003e h^2 + k^2 - (h^2 - 2h x1 + x1^2 + k^2 - 2k y1 + y1^2) = 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468163323,"data":"       | =\u003e 2h x1 + 2k y1 - (x1^2 + y1^2) = 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468164618,"data":"       | =\u003e h x1 + k y1 = (x1^2 + y1^2)/2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468165878,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468167012,"data":"       | Similarly, with K' we have:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468168239,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468169394,"data":"       | h x2 + k y2 = (x2^2 + y2^2)/2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468170613,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468171726,"data":"       | Thus we have linear system:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468172932,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468174055,"data":"       | [ x1  y1 ] [h] = [(x1^2 + y1^2)/2]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468175309,"data":"       | [ x2  y2 ] [k]   [(x2^2 + y2^2)/2]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468176521,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468177694,"data":"       | Solve for (h,k). This works as long as K and K' not collinear with origin (i.e., determinant non-zero). This is robust.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468179099,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468180209,"data":"       | Thus we can compute O_c using this linear system.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468181471,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.46818259,"data":"       | Let's implement this.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468183779,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.4681849,"data":"       | assistantanalysis to=python codedef circumcenter_from_origin(p1, p2):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468186168,"data":"       |     # p1 = (x1, y1), p2 = (x2, y2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468187398,"data":"       |     x1, y1 = p1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468188621,"data":"       |     x2, y2 = p2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468189776,"data":"       |     # solve linear system:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468190953,"data":"       |     # x1*h + y1*k = (x1^2 + y1^2)/2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468192141,"data":"       |     # x2*h + y2*k = (x2^2 + y2^2)/2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.46819335,"data":"       |     A = np.array([[x1, y1], [x2, y2]], dtype=float)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468194644,"data":"       |     b = np.array([(x1**2 + y1**2)/2.0, (x2**2 + y2**2)/2.0], dtype=float)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.46819595,"data":"       |     # check determinant\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468197111,"data":"       |     det = np.linalg.det(A)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468198337,"data":"       |     if abs(det) \u003c 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468199583,"data":"       |         return None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468200772,"data":"       |     sol = np.linalg.solve(A, b)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468201962,"data":"       |     return (sol[0], sol[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468203169,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468204508,"data":"       | def ratio_for_n_explicit_numpy2(n):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468205723,"data":"       |     d = float(sp.fibonacci(n))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468206891,"data":"       |     e = float(sp.fibonacci(n+1))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468208093,"data":"       |     Delta = float(sp.fibonacci(n-1))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468210355,"data":"       |     L = d + e\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468211587,"data":"       |     c = d + 0.5 * Delta\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468212779,"data":"       |     # coordinates\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468213942,"data":"       |     x = (L**2 - 2*c*Delta - Delta**2) / (2*L)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468215178,"data":"       |     y_sq = c**2 - x**2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468216388,"data":"       |     y = mp.sqrt(y_sq)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468217579,"data":"       |     s = c + d + Delta\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468218806,"data":"       |     area = 0.5 * L * y\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468219996,"data":"       |     r = area / s\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468221156,"data":"       |     I = (d, r)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468222321,"data":"       |     # foot F\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468223518,"data":"       |     tF = (I[0]*x + I[1]*y) / (c**2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468224718,"data":"       |     F = (tF * x, tF * y)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468225888,"data":"       |     # foot E\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.46822703,"data":"       |     vAC = (x - L, y)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468228235,"data":"       |     w = (d - L, r)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.46822945,"data":"       |     tE = (w[0]*vAC[0] + w[1]*vAC[1]) / ((c+Delta)**2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468230703,"data":"       |     E = (L + tE * (x - L), tE * y)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468231889,"data":"       |     D = (d, 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468233073,"data":"       |     # projection D onto EF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468234267,"data":"       |     vEF = (F[0] - E[0], F[1] - E[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468235493,"data":"       |     DE = (D[0] - E[0], D[1] - E[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468240518,"data":"       |     t_param = (DE[0]*vEF[0] + DE[1]*vEF[1]) / (vEF[0]**2 + vEF[1]**2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468241928,"data":"       |     N = (E[0] + t_param * vEF[0], E[1] + t_param * vEF[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468243232,"data":"       |     # circumcenter O\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.46824439,"data":"       |     O = (L/2.0, (x**2 + y**2 - x*L) / (2*y))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468245771,"data":"       |     R = mp.sqrt(O[0]**2 + O[1]**2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468246991,"data":"       |     # exsimilicenter X\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468248194,"data":"       |     X = ((R*I[0] - r*O[0])/(R - r), (R*I[1] - r*O[1])/(R - r))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468249464,"data":"       |     # line AX intersect circumcircle at K\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468250838,"data":"       |     u = (X[0] - x, X[1] - y)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468252097,"data":"       |     Ax = x - O[0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468253421,"data":"       |     Ay = y - O[1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468254565,"data":"       |     a_coef = u[0]**2 + u[1]**2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468255875,"data":"       |     b_coef = 2*(Ax*u[0] + Ay*u[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468257079,"data":"       |     c_coef = Ax**2 + Ay**2 - R**2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468260657,"data":"       |     disc = b_coef**2 - 4*a_coef*c_coef\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.46826663,"data":"       |     sqrt_disc = mp.sqrt(disc)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468268021,"data":"       |     s1 = (-b_coef + sqrt_disc) / (2*a_coef)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.46826931,"data":"       |     s2 = (-b_coef - sqrt_disc) / (2*a_coef)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468270638,"data":"       |     sK = s1 if abs(s1) \u003e 1e-12 else s2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468271869,"data":"       |     K = (x + sK*u[0], y + sK*u[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468273064,"data":"       |     # reflect K across EF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468274264,"data":"       |     v = (F[0] - E[0], F[1] - E[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468275477,"data":"       |     KE = (K[0] - E[0], K[1] - E[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468276672,"data":"       |     dot_KE_v = KE[0]*v[0] + KE[1]*v[1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468277906,"data":"       |     dot_v = v[0]**2 + v[1]**2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468279615,"data":"       |     proj = dot_KE_v / dot_v\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.46828084,"data":"       |     foot = (E[0] + proj*v[0], E[1] + proj*v[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468282065,"data":"       |     Kprime = (2*foot[0] - K[0], 2*foot[1] - K[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468283308,"data":"       |     # circumcenter of B,K,Kprime using linear system\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468284529,"data":"       |     O_c = circumcenter_from_origin(K, Kprime)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468285948,"data":"       |     if O_c is None:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.46828711,"data":"       |         raise ValueError(\"O_c None\")\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468288363,"data":"       |     # compute T\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468289586,"data":"       |     BN_dir = (N[0], N[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468290778,"data":"       |     perp_BN_dir = (-BN_dir[1], BN_dir[0])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468291981,"data":"       |     mid_BK = (K[0]/2.0, K[1]/2.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468293177,"data":"       |     perp_BK_dir = (-K[1], K[0])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468294393,"data":"       |     A_mat = np.array([[perp_BN_dir[0], -perp_BK_dir[0]],\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468295668,"data":"       |                      [perp_BN_dir[1], -perp_BK_dir[1]]], dtype=float)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468296941,"data":"       |     b_vec = np.array([mid_BK[0], mid_BK[1]], dtype=float)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468298188,"data":"       |     sol = np.linalg.solve(A_mat, b_vec)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468299441,"data":"       |     s_val = sol[0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468300608,"data":"       |     O_T = (s_val*perp_BN_dir[0], s_val*perp_BN_dir[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468301876,"data":"       |     t_val = 2*O_T[0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468303068,"data":"       |     # distances\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468304228,"data":"       |     NB = mp.sqrt(N[0]**2 + N[1]**2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468305455,"data":"       |     NE = mp.sqrt((N[0]-E[0])**2 + (N[1]-E[1])**2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468306713,"data":"       |     CT = L - t_val\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468307904,"data":"       |     BT = t_val\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468309082,"data":"       |     ratio = (CT * NB) / (BT * NE)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468310306,"data":"       |     return ratio\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468312445,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468313604,"data":"       | for n in range(5,13):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.46831483,"data":"       |     print(n, ratio_for_n_explicit_numpy2(n))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468316055,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.468317167,"data":"     [Code] [ERROR]:\n"}
