,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.470338324,"data":"       | analysist/L seems converging to about 0.32071... So BT/BC tends to about 0.32071. Then CT/BT = (L - t)/t = (1 - t/L) / (t/L) = (1 - p) / p where p = t/L ≈ 0.32071. So (L - t)/t = (1-p)/p ≈ (0.67929)/0.32071 ≈ 2.117... Indeed (1-p)/p = (1/p) - 1 ≈ (1/0.32071) - 1 ≈ 3.119 - 1 = 2.119. Let's compute.\n"}
