,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.471422652,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.471423771,"data":"       | Given B=(0,0), C=(a,0), D=(c0,0), I=(c0, r). Compute F and E coordinates as formulas above.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.471425056,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.471426199,"data":"       | Compute line BF and line CE intersection to get A.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.471428425,"data":"       | \n"}
