,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.47171378,"data":"       | analysisActually foot of perpendicular from P to line AB is projection onto line AB, which is the midpoint of P and its reflection across line AB. So we can compute projection using formula.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.471715278,"data":"       | \n"}
