,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475585021,"data":"       \u003e \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475586294,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475587474,"data":"     [Turn 56]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475588617,"data":"     [Reasoning] (2949 chars):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475590129,"data":"       | analysisThe list of roots is huge; we printed many values because we used many points and sign changes; many false positives due to noise? Actually find_all_roots is scanning for sign changes of cond across many r values; but cond may oscillate many times due to numeric errors or near-zero crossing due to degenerate cases. This is messy.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475591931,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475593135,"data":"       | We need a more robust approach: For given c0,d0, there may be only a few valid roots where the condition holds and circumcenter defined. Our earlier approach with find_all_roots gave many spurious values because cond may cross zero many times due to numeric noise.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475594772,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.47559596,"data":"       | Better approach: Use root-finding near the known root for moderate n, and track the root that yields valid ratio. For large n, we can guess that there is a unique root near r ≈ 0.785*c0 (as observed). So we can use initial guess r0 = 0.785*c0 and use Newton's method or bisection to find root.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475597674,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475598879,"data":"       | We can also compute cond as a function of r and see monotonic behavior near that region.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475600196,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.4756014,"data":"       | Let's plot cond for n=26 (c0=F_26). Compute cond for r values around 0.78*c0.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475602691,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475603834,"data":"       | assistantanalysis to=python codedef cond_value(c0, d0, r):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475605086,"data":"       |     try:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475606274,"data":"       |         cond, _, _ = compute_ratio_numeric(c0, d0, r)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475607529,"data":"       |         return cond\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475608747,"data":"       |     except Exception:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475609916,"data":"       |         return None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475611081,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475613234,"data":"       | def find_root_near(c0, d0, r_guess):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475614534,"data":"       |     # Use bisection around r_guess; find interval where cond changes sign\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475615849,"data":"       |     # Search left and right multiplicative factors\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.4756171,"data":"       |     factor = 0.5\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475618282,"data":"       |     lo = r_guess * factor\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475619495,"data":"       |     hi = r_guess / factor\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475620723,"data":"       |     # ensure cond defined at ends\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475621941,"data":"       |     cond_lo = cond_value(c0, d0, lo)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475623129,"data":"       |     cond_hi = cond_value(c0, d0, hi)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475624318,"data":"       |     # Expand interval until sign change\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475625513,"data":"       |     for _ in range(50):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475626673,"data":"       |         if cond_lo is None:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475627858,"data":"       |             lo *= 0.5\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475629038,"data":"       |             cond_lo = cond_value(c0, d0, lo)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.47563026,"data":"       |         if cond_hi is None:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475631442,"data":"       |             hi *= 2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475632611,"data":"       |             cond_hi = cond_value(c0, d0, hi)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475633863,"data":"       |         if cond_lo is not None and cond_hi is not None and cond_lo*cond_hi \u003c 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475635243,"data":"       |             break\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475636409,"data":"       |         # expand\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475637587,"data":"       |         lo *= 0.5\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475639123,"data":"       |         hi *= 2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475640306,"data":"       |         cond_lo = cond_value(c0, d0, lo)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475641496,"data":"       |         cond_hi = cond_value(c0, d0, hi)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.47564272,"data":"       |     if cond_lo is None or cond_hi is None or cond_lo*cond_hi \u003e 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475644066,"data":"       |         return None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.47564524,"data":"       |     # bisection\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475646418,"data":"       |     for _ in range(80):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475647628,"data":"       |         mid = (lo+hi)/2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475649339,"data":"       |         cond_mid = cond_value(c0, d0, mid)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475650563,"data":"       |         if cond_mid is None:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.47565175,"data":"       |             # adjust\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475652938,"data":"       |             lo = mid\n"}
