,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.475833507,"data":"       | Thus there are multiple roots where cond=0, and ratio varies. For n=26, the root near 106922 yields ratio ~2.186, while root near 283661 yields ratio ~0.2319 (maybe another root). So we need to find the maximum ratio across all roots.\n"}
