,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.477277383,"data":"       | Set c0 = 1, d0 = φ. Compute ratio function for variable r.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.477278644,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.477279816,"data":"       | We need to find r \u003e 0 such that condition cond=0 (B,N,K,K' cyclic). Let's find roots.\n"}
