,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.48151823,"data":"       | x_A = -( sin(B) + sin(C) * ? Wait expression: -sin(B)/(sin(B)*cos(C) + sin(C)*cos(B)) - sin(C)/(sin(B)*cos(C) + sin(C)*cos(B))\n"}
