,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481530362,"data":"       | We can simplify denominator: sin B cos C + sin C cos B = sin(B + C). Indeed sin B cos C + cos B sin C = sin(B + C). So denominator = sin(B + C).\n"}
