,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481545151,"data":"       | A_x = - [2 sin((B+C)/2) cos((B-C)/2)] / [2 sin((B+C)/2) cos((B+C)/2)] = - cos((B-C)/2) / cos((B+C)/2).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481546498,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481547647,"data":"       | Similarly, A_y = (cos B - cos C) / sin(B + C) = [-2 sin((B+C)/2) sin((B-C)/2)] / [2 sin((B+C)/2) cos((B+C)/2)] = - sin((B-C)/2) / cos((B+C)/2).\n"}
