,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481902094,"data":"       | Compute A using derived formula: A = ( -cos((B-C)/2)/cos((B+C)/2), - sin((B-C)/2)/cos((B+C)/2) ). But we can compute using sec: A = -(cos((B-C)/2), sin((B-C)/2)) / cos((B+C)/2). Use math.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481903565,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481904708,"data":"       | Now compute circle through three points: we can compute center and radius via circumcenter formula.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481906055,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.48190741,"data":"       | Given three points p1, p2, p3, we can compute circumcenter using perpendicular bisectors.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481908713,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481909857,"data":"       | Implement function circumcenter(p1,p2,p3) returning (cx,cy), radius.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481911125,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481912324,"data":"       | Then compute intersection of two circles: given centers c1, r1, c2, r2, compute intersection points. There can be two points; we need the one not equal to A.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481913775,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481914911,"data":"       | Compute K.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481916054,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481917246,"data":"       | Compute K' reflection across line EF: reflection of point across line defined by two points.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481918561,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481919732,"data":"       | Compute N: projection of D onto line EF.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.48192093,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481922072,"data":"       | Compute circle through B and K tangent to BN at B: we can compute center O_T as intersection of line through B perpendicular to BN, and perpendicular bisector of BK.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.4819235,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481924631,"data":"       | Compute T: intersection of that circle with line BC (x=1). Compute other intersection.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481925956,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481927136,"data":"       | Compute ratio.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481928278,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481930946,"data":"       | Compute cyclic condition: check if K,N,K',B are concyclic: we can compute the signed area of quadrilateral? Or compute distances from circumcenter? Simpler: Compute circle through three points K,N,B, then check if K' lies on same circle (distance to center equals radius). Use tolerance.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481932651,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481933802,"data":"       | Thus we can test condition.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481934981,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481936121,"data":"       | Now we need to find B values that satisfy cyclic condition exactly (or within tolerance). Since cyclic condition may be automatically satisfied for all B? Let's test numeric.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481937599,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481938748,"data":"       | assistantanalysis to=python codeimport math\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481939959,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481941117,"data":"       | def circumcenter(p1, p2, p3):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481942351,"data":"       |     # returns center (cx,cy) and radius\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481943593,"data":"       |     (x1,y1),(x2,y2),(x3,y3) = p1,p2,p3\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481944782,"data":"       |     d = 2*(x1*(y2-y3) + x2*(y3-y1) + x3*(y1-y2))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481946047,"data":"       |     if abs(d) \u003c 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481947269,"data":"       |         return None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481948496,"data":"       |     ux = ((x1**2 + y1**2)*(y2 - y3) + (x2**2 + y2**2)*(y3 - y1) + (x3**2 + y3**2)*(y1 - y2)) / d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481949846,"data":"       |     uy = ((x1**2 + y1**2)*(x3 - x2) + (x2**2 + y2**2)*(x1 - x3) + (x3**2 + y3**2)*(x2 - x1)) / d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481951142,"data":"       |     r = math.hypot(ux - x1, uy - y1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481952376,"data":"       |     return (ux, uy), r\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481953551,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481954677,"data":"       | def circle_intersections(c1, r1, c2, r2):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481955904,"data":"       |     (x0,y0) = c1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.48195707,"data":"       |     (x1,y1) = c2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481958315,"data":"       |     dx = x1 - x0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481959497,"data":"       |     dy = y1 - y0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481960675,"data":"       |     d = math.hypot(dx, dy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481961957,"data":"       |     if d \u003e r1 + r2 + 1e-12 or d \u003c abs(r1 - r2) - 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481963291,"data":"       |         return []  # no intersection\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.48196449,"data":"       |     # a = (r1^2 - r2^2 + d^2) / (2d)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481965682,"data":"       |     a = (r1**2 - r2**2 + d**2) / (2*d)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481966893,"data":"       |     # h = sqrt(r1^2 - a^2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481968127,"data":"       |     h_sq = r1**2 - a**2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481969299,"data":"       |     if h_sq \u003c -1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481970502,"data":"       |         return []\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481971657,"data":"       |     h = math.sqrt(max(h_sq, 0.0))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481974031,"data":"       |     # point P2 = P0 + a*(P1-P0)/d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481975265,"data":"       |     xm = x0 + a * dx / d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.48197646,"data":"       |     ym = y0 + a * dy / d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481977665,"data":"       |     # intersection points\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481978941,"data":"       |     rx = -dy * (h / d)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481980139,"data":"       |     ry = dx * (h / d)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481981305,"data":"       |     p_int1 = (xm + rx, ym + ry)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481982508,"data":"       |     p_int2 = (xm - rx, ym - ry)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481983707,"data":"       |     if h \u003c 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481984962,"data":"       |         return [p_int1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481986359,"data":"       |     else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481987555,"data":"       |         return [p_int1, p_int2]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481988824,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481989951,"data":"       | def reflect_point_across_line(P, A, B):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.48199114,"data":"       |     # reflect point P across line through A and B\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481992373,"data":"       |     # using projection formula\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481993556,"data":"       |     # line AB direction vector\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481994757,"data":"       |     (x1,y1) = A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481995908,"data":"       |     (x2,y2) = B\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481997095,"data":"       |     (px,py) = P\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481998279,"data":"       |     # compute projection of P onto line AB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.481999495,"data":"       |     dx = x2 - x1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482000678,"data":"       |     dy = y2 - y1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482001853,"data":"       |     # if line degenerate\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482003029,"data":"       |     if abs(dx) \u003c 1e-12 and abs(dy) \u003c 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482004318,"data":"       |         return P\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482005475,"data":"       |     # projection factor t\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482006702,"data":"       |     t = ((px - x1)*dx + (py - y1)*dy) / (dx*dx + dy*dy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482007984,"data":"       |     proj_x = x1 + t*dx\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482009172,"data":"       |     proj_y = y1 + t*dy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482010354,"data":"       |     # reflection\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482011531,"data":"       |     rx = 2*proj_x - px\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482012682,"data":"       |     ry = 2*proj_y - py\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482013822,"data":"       |     return (rx, ry)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482014977,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482016109,"data":"       | def foot_of_perpendicular(P, A, B):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482017336,"data":"       |     # foot from point P to line AB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.482018587,"data":"       |     return reflect_point_across_line(P, A, B)  # Actually reflection across line yields symmetric point; foot is projection.\n"}
