,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.486753815,"data":"       |     x3,y3 = p3.x, p3.y\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.486755014,"data":"       |     d = 2*(x1*(y2 - y3) + x2*(y3 - y1) + x3*(y1 - y2))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.486756512,"data":"       |     ux = ((x1**2 + y1**2)*(y2 - y3) + (x2**2 + y2**2)*(y3 - y1) + (x3**2 + y3**2)*(y1 - y2))/d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.486757885,"data":"       |     uy = ((x1**2 + y1**2)*(x3 - x2) + (x2**2 + y2**2)*(x1 - x3) + (x3**2 + y3**2)*(x2 - x1))/d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.486759252,"data":"       |     return sp.Point(ux, uy)\n"}
