,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.486930404,"data":"       | Consider triangle ABC with incircle radius r. Points D,E,F tangency. N is foot from D onto EF. There is known property: N is the midpoint of the arc EF of the incircle? Actually foot from D to chord EF is not midpoint generally.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.486931996,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.48693315,"data":"       | But there is known property: Quadrilateral K,N,K',B cyclic may impose relation like B = 2*C? Not.\n"}
