,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.487835914,"data":"       | Given that A, F, E are on both circles? Actually A, F, E are on circumcircle of AFE. The circumcircle of ABC passes through A, B, C. So K is the other intersection of these two circles besides A.\n"}
