,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.488301629,"data":"       | Let's compute O1, R1 for circle ABC: O1 = circumcenter of triangle ABC. We can compute using sympy function sp.geometry.Point.circumcircle? Actually sp.Circle(A,B,C) returns circle object; we can get center and radius.\n"}
