,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49568405,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49568546,"data":"       | Thus α may be limit as D_cross → 0 of ratio expression under cyclic condition.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495686833,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495687972,"data":"       | Thus we can compute α by taking limit where BN parallel to K (i.e., cross product zero) while still satisfying cyclic condition.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495689389,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495690543,"data":"       | Thus we need to find limit of ratio as D_cross → 0 under cyclic condition.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495691891,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495693028,"data":"       | Thus we can treat D_cross as variable, set D_cross = 0 in equations? But cyclic condition may impose relation that yields finite limit.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495694446,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49569558,"data":"       | Thus we can attempt to solve for configuration where BN is parallel to K (i.e., cross product zero) and cyclic condition holds. Solve for r such that both conditions hold (determinant = 0 and cross product = 0). That may give a specific r leading to α.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495697271,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495698414,"data":"       | Let's attempt to solve system: det = 0 and cross = 0.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495699691,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495700817,"data":"       | Compute cross = v_x*k_y - v_y*k_x.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495702045,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495703191,"data":"       | Set both zero.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495704365,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495705513,"data":"       | Solve for r.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495706654,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495707783,"data":"       | Let's try using sympy for p=1, q=phi.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495708971,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495710133,"data":"       | assistantanalysis to=python codep_sym = sp.Integer(1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49571141,"data":"       | q_sym = (1+sp.sqrt(5))/2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495712606,"data":"       | r_sym = sp.symbols('r', positive=True, real=True)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495713853,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495715021,"data":"       | # define points and compute N, K as before but using sympy functions (maybe heavy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495716364,"data":"       | # We'll reuse earlier functions but adapt to return symbolic expressions for N, K, cross, det.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495717702,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495718816,"data":"       | def symbolic_geometry(p_sym, q_sym, r_sym):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495720105,"data":"       |     B = sp.Point(0,0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495721353,"data":"       |     C = sp.Point(p_sym+q_sym, 0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495724452,"data":"       |     I = sp.Point(p_sym, r_sym)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495725702,"data":"       |     # slopes\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495726869,"data":"       |     mB = 2*p_sym*r_sym/(p_sym**2 - r_sym**2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495728104,"data":"       |     mC = 2*q_sym*r_sym/(q_sym**2 - r_sym**2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495729327,"data":"       |     xA = -mC*(p_sym+q_sym)/(mB - mC)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495730557,"data":"       |     yA = mB*xA\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495731707,"data":"       |     A = sp.Point(xA, yA)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49573296,"data":"       |     Fx = p_sym*(p_sym**2 - r_sym**2)/(p_sym**2 + r_sym**2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495734215,"data":"       |     Fy = 2*p_sym**2*r_sym/(p_sym**2 + r_sym**2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495735437,"data":"       |     F = sp.Point(Fx, Fy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.4957366,"data":"       |     line_AI = sp.Line(A, I)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495737775,"data":"       |     E = F.reflect(line_AI)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495740099,"data":"       |     D = sp.Point(p_sym, 0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495741245,"data":"       |     line_EF = sp.Line(E, F)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495742579,"data":"       |     N = line_EF.projection(D)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495743786,"data":"       |     # circumcenter O1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495744923,"data":"       |     a = p_sym+q_sym\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495746087,"data":"       |     xO1 = a/2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495747194,"data":"       |     yO1 = ((xA - xO1)**2 + yA**2 - xO1**2) / (2*yA)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49574837,"data":"       |     O1 = sp.Point(xO1, yO1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495749499,"data":"       |     R1_sq = xO1**2 + yO1**2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495750641,"data":"       |     # circumcenter O2 of AFE\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495751806,"data":"       |     O2 = sp.Point(sp.geometry.Triangle(A, F, E).circumcenter)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495753067,"data":"       |     R2_sq = O2.distance(A)**2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495754224,"data":"       |     # vector d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495755354,"data":"       |     dx = O2.x - O1.x\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495756516,"data":"       |     dy = O2.y - O1.y\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49575765,"data":"       |     d_sq = dx**2 + dy**2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495758803,"data":"       |     d = sp.sqrt(d_sq)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495759909,"data":"       |     a_dist = (R1_sq - R2_sq + d_sq) / (2*d)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49576107,"data":"       |     h_sq = R1_sq - a_dist**2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495762279,"data":"       |     ux = dx/d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495763422,"data":"       |     uy = dy/d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495764537,"data":"       |     Px = O1.x + a_dist*ux\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495765666,"data":"       |     Py = O1.y + a_dist*uy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495766834,"data":"       |     perp_x = -uy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495767952,"data":"       |     perp_y = ux\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495769087,"data":"       |     # K candidates\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495772016,"data":"       |     K1 = sp.Point(Px + sp.sqrt(h_sq)*perp_x, Py + sp.sqrt(h_sq)*perp_y)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495773337,"data":"       |     K2 = sp.Point(Px - sp.sqrt(h_sq)*perp_x, Py - sp.sqrt(h_sq)*perp_y)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495774566,"data":"       |     # choose K not equal to A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495775697,"data":"       |     # We'll keep both for now\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49577685,"data":"       |     return A,B,C,F,E,N,O1,O2,K1,K2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495778054,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495779163,"data":"       | A,B,C,F,E,N,O1,O2,K1,K2 = symbolic_geometry(p_sym,q_sym,r_sym)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495780409,"data":"       | # define cross product for K1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495781561,"data":"       | v = sp.Point(N.x, N.y)  # BN vector\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495782743,"data":"       | cross_K1 = v.x*K1.y - v.y*K1.x\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49578388,"data":"       | # determinant for cyclic condition using K1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495785057,"data":"       | def det_cyclic(K):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49578622,"data":"       |     # Build matrix\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495787341,"data":"       |     M = sp.Matrix([[B.x, B.y, B.x**2 + B.y**2, 1],\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495788532,"data":"       |                    [N.x, N.y, N.x**2 + N.y**2, 1],\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495789697,"data":"       |                    [K.x, K.y, K.x**2 + K.y**2, 1],\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495790912,"data":"       |                    [K.reflect(sp.Line(E,F)).x, K.reflect(sp.Line(E,F)).y,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495792209,"data":"       |                     K.reflect(sp.Line(E,F)).x**2 + K.reflect(sp.Line(E,F)).y**2, 1]])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495793477,"data":"       |     return sp.simplify(M.det())\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495802981,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495804122,"data":"       | det1 = det_cyclic(K1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495805251,"data":"       | det2 = det_cyclic(K2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495806401,"data":"       | det1_s = sp.simplify(det1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495807569,"data":"       | det2_s = sp.simplify(det2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49580876,"data":"       | det1_s\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.495810534,"data":"       | \n"}
