,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497401251,"data":"     [Turn 3]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49740237,"data":"     [Reasoning] (17153 chars):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497403551,"data":"       | analysisThe symbolic expression for K and cyclic condition may be heavy causing timeouts. Need to simplify.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497404847,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497405978,"data":"       | We can try to compute K using known property: K is the A-mixtilinear touch point. There are known formulas for K coordinates in terms of triangle angles and sides, perhaps easier.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497407421,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497408542,"data":"       | But maybe we can avoid heavy symbolic geometry by using known angle relationships.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49740982,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497411122,"data":"       | Alternatively, we can use numeric geometry with direct coordinate solving using intersection of circles using numeric methods rather than symbolic.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497412524,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497413655,"data":"       | We can treat unknown coordinates as numeric variables and solve using numeric methods (Newton) for given n and unknown s.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497415018,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497416107,"data":"       | Better approach: Use numeric geometry functions from shapely? Not available.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497417357,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497418474,"data":"       | But we can implement using sympy numeric functions but with high-level functions maybe still heavy.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497421231,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497422394,"data":"       | Alternatively, we can use analytic formulas for incircle and circumcircle.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497423647,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497424747,"data":"       | Let's derive formulas.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497425872,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497427014,"data":"       | Given triangle coordinates as earlier: B = (0,0), C = (a,0), A = (x_A, y_A). With side lengths a, b, c.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.4974283,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497429405,"data":"       | We have incircle center I = (d, r) where d = BD = s - b = F_n (given) and r = incircle radius.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49743069,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497431844,"data":"       | We can compute r using formula: r = Δ / s. Δ = area = (1/2) * a * y_A (since base BC horizontal). So Δ = (a * y_A)/2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497433254,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497434372,"data":"       | Thus r = Δ / s = (a * y_A) / (2 s).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497435564,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497436648,"data":"       | But also I is at (d, r). So we have y_A expressed in terms of r and s: y_A = 2 s r / a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497437894,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497439045,"data":"       | But also we have coordinates of A expressed earlier: x_A = (c^2 - b^2 + a^2) / (2 a). And also AB length c = sqrt(x_A^2 + y_A^2). This should hold.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49744046,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497442191,"data":"       | We can also express b, c in terms of s: b = s - d, c = s - c_seg.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497443434,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497444581,"data":"       | Thus we have unknown s and unknown r (or y_A). But they are related via geometry: incircle center must be at distance r from AB and AC as well.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49744593,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497447081,"data":"       | But we can compute r using formula for incircle radius in terms of side lengths: r = sqrt( (s - a)(s - b)(s - c) / s ). That's from formula r = Δ / s and Δ = sqrt(s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c) ) (Heron). So r = sqrt( (s-a)(s-b)(s-c) / s ).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497448657,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497449771,"data":"       | Thus we can compute r directly from s.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49745095,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497452088,"data":"       | Thus we can compute coordinates of A: y_A = 2Δ / a = 2 * sqrt(s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)) / a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497453391,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497454721,"data":"       | Thus we can compute all coordinates purely in terms of s.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497455924,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497457031,"data":"       | Thus we can implement numeric functions for given n and unknown s, compute K, etc.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497458294,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497459461,"data":"       | But computing K still requires intersection of circles. But we can compute K using known formula for A-mixtilinear touch point: In terms of triangle angles, K lies on circumcircle Ω such that lines BK and CK intersect at the exsimilicenter? Not recall.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497462835,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497464034,"data":"       | Better to compute K as intersection of circumcircle Ω with circumcircle of AFE. So we need to compute circle through A, F, E. That's doable numerically using three points.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497465487,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497466617,"data":"       | Thus we can compute K numerically for given s.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497467797,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497468902,"data":"       | Thus we can set up a function that given n and s returns the cyclic condition value (distance difference) and ratio R.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497470211,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497471318,"data":"       | Then we can solve for s using numeric root-finding.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49747255,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497473711,"data":"       | We need to handle potential multiple solutions; choose the one that yields AB != AC (i.e., b != c). Since b - c = F_{n-1} nonzero for n≥2, that's satisfied.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497475161,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497476265,"data":"       | Now we need to find s \u003e a such that cyclic condition holds.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497477541,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497478647,"data":"       | Let's implement numeric functions using numpy for speed.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49747984,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497480954,"data":"       | We'll use sympy's nsolve but with numeric functions maybe heavy. Let's use custom root-finding with scipy? Not available. Could use simple binary search if monotonic.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497482344,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497483492,"data":"       | But we can try to use sympy's nsolve with numeric expression built using sympy functions but not symbolic sqrt of symbolic expressions? Actually we can define s as a sympy symbol and define expressions using sqrt and rational numbers; sympy's nsolve may handle.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497485078,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497486224,"data":"       | But earlier attempt timed out due to heavy symbolic expression for K (intersection of circles). However we can compute K using analytic formulas: Intersection of two circles can be expressed as solving linear equations.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497487701,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497488998,"data":"       | Given two circles: circle1: center O1, radius R1; circle2: center O2, radius R2. Intersection points satisfy distances to O1 and O2. Solve for intersection coordinates.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497490395,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497491531,"data":"       | But we have circumcircle of ABC (Ω) with known center O (circumcenter) and radius R. And circle of AFE (call M) with known center O2 and radius R2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49749293,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497494047,"data":"       | Thus we can compute K as second intersection.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497495208,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497496327,"data":"       | Circumcenter O of triangle ABC: For coordinates B(0,0), C(a,0), A(x_A, y_A). Since BC is horizontal, the perpendicular bisector of BC is x = a/2. The perpendicular bisector of AB is line perpendicular to AB passing through its midpoint. Intersection gives O.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49749945,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497500597,"data":"       | Alternatively, we can compute O using formula: coordinates (a/2, (x_A^2 + y_A^2 - a x_A) / (2 y_A) ). Let's derive.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497501897,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497503011,"data":"       | Given B (0,0), C (a,0). The circumcenter O lies at (a/2, y_O). Since O is equidistant from B and C, its x-coordinate is a/2. Distance to B: sqrt((a/2)^2 + y_O^2) = R. Distance to A: sqrt((x_A - a/2)^2 + (y_A - y_O)^2) = R. Equate squares: (a/2)^2 + y_O^2 = (x_A - a/2)^2 + (y_A - y_O)^2. Expand: (a^2/4) + y_O^2 = (x_A - a/2)^2 + y_A^2 - 2 y_A y_O + y_O^2. Cancel y_O^2. So (a^2/4) = (x_A - a/2)^2 + y_A^2 - 2 y_A y_O. Solve for y_O: 2 y_A y_O = (x_A - a/2)^2 + y_A^2 - a^2/4. So y_O = ((x_A - a/2)^2 + y_A^2 - a^2/4) / (2 y_A). Simplify: (x_A^2 - a x_A + a^2/4 + y_A^2 - a^2/4) / (2 y_A) = (x_A^2 - a x_A + y_A^2) / (2 y_A). So O = (a/2, (x_A^2 - a x_A + y_A^2) / (2 y_A)). Good.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497505288,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497506424,"data":"       | Thus we can compute O.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497507557,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497508674,"data":"       | Radius R = distance from O to B: sqrt((a/2)^2 + y_O^2).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497509857,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497510968,"data":"       | Now circle of AFE: we can compute its center O2 as circumcenter of triangle A, F, E. Use general formula for circumcenter given three points.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497512324,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497513448,"data":"       | We can compute O2 using linear algebra: intersection of perpendicular bisectors of AF and AE.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497514711,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497515827,"data":"       | Given coordinates of A, F, E, we can compute O2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497517011,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497518127,"data":"       | Then compute intersection of circles (O,R) and (O2,R2). Solve for intersection points.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497519377,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497520715,"data":"       | We know one intersection is A. So we can compute the other by solving line through O and O2? Actually the line connecting the two centers passes through the intersection points. The two circles intersect at points that lie on the line connecting centers? No, intersection points lie on line perpendicular to line O-O2 (the radical line). Actually the radical line is perpendicular to O-O2, but not necessarily passing through A. However we can compute intersection points using geometry.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497522668,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497523828,"data":"       | Simplify: Since A is known intersection point, we can compute K as the other intersection. So we can find K by reflecting A across line that is the common chord? Actually chord of intersection is line through intersection points; its perpendicular bisector is line O-O2. So chord line is perpendicular to O-O2 and passes through midpoint of the two intersection points. Since we know one intersection point A, we can find the other intersection K by reflecting A across the line that is the perpendicular bisector of the segment connecting the two intersection points? Wait we can compute K using formula: For two intersecting circles, the two intersection points are symmetric with respect to line O-O2. So the line O-O2 is the perpendicular bisector of segment connecting the two intersection points. Therefore, given A, we can find K as the reflection of A across line O-O2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497528154,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49752935,"data":"       | Thus K is the reflection of A across line O-O2 (the line joining the centers). Indeed, if two circles intersect at points P and Q, then the line joining the centers O and O' is the perpendicular bisector of chord PQ. So P and Q are symmetric across line O-O'. So K is reflection of A across line O-O2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497530985,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497532125,"data":"       | Thus we can compute K easily: reflect A across line O-O2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49753334,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497534451,"data":"       | Thus we avoid solving intersection.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497535607,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497536695,"data":"       | Now we can compute K'.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497537848,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497538972,"data":"       | Now we need to check cyclic condition: Points K, N, K', B concyclic.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497540194,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49754131,"data":"       | We can compute condition that distances from O' (center of circle through K,N,B) are equal.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497542572,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497543927,"data":"       | But we can compute using condition that cross ratio? Simpler: Compute the circumcircle of triangle K,N,B (if not collinear) and test if K' lies on it: distance from K' to circumcenter equals radius.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.4975454,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497546502,"data":"       | Thus we can compute numeric.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497547644,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497548784,"data":"       | Now we can solve for s.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49754993,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497551057,"data":"       | Let's implement numeric functions using numpy (or sympy with numeric evaluation). Use python functions.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497552328,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497553427,"data":"       | We'll need to compute square roots, etc.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497554597,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497555702,"data":"       | Let's code using Python's math and numpy.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49755688,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497558007,"data":"       | assistantanalysis to=python codeimport math\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497559174,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497560254,"data":"       | def triangle_data(n, s):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497561434,"data":"       |     # returns dictionary of geometric quantities for given n and semiperimeter s\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497562695,"data":"       |     # n integer, s \u003e a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497563877,"data":"       |     a = fibonacci(n+2)  # BC\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497565041,"data":"       |     d = fibonacci(n)    # BD\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497567905,"data":"       |     c_seg = fibonacci(n+1)  # CD\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497569148,"data":"       |     # side lengths\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497570301,"data":"       |     b = s - d   # CA\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49757144,"data":"       |     c = s - c_seg  # AB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49757258,"data":"       |     # check positivity\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497573745,"data":"       |     if b \u003c= 0 or c \u003c= 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49757501,"data":"       |         raise ValueError(\"Invalid s\")\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497576225,"data":"       |     # coordinates\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497577384,"data":"       |     # x_A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497578507,"data":"       |     xA = (c**2 - b**2 + a**2) / (2*a)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497579665,"data":"       |     # y_A from area formula: using Heron\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.49758086,"data":"       |     s_val = s\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497581991,"data":"       |     # area using Heron\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497583157,"data":"       |     area = math.sqrt(s_val * (s_val - a) * (s_val - b) * (s_val - c))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.4975844,"data":"       |     yA = 2 * area / a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497585551,"data":"       |     # Points\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497586641,"data":"       |     B = (0.0, 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497587804,"data":"       |     C = (float(a), 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497588909,"data":"       |     A = (xA, yA)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497590054,"data":"       |     # incircle center I = (d, r)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497591197,"data":"       |     r = area / s_val\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497592314,"data":"       |     I = (float(d), r)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497593465,"data":"       |     # compute F: point on AB at distance BF = d from B along AB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497594704,"data":"       |     # AB length = c\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497595827,"data":"       |     # unit vector from B to A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497597001,"data":"       |     ux = (A[0] - B[0]) / c\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497598154,"data":"       |     uy = (A[1] - B[1]) / c\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497599334,"data":"       |     F = (B[0] + ux * d, B[1] + uy * d)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497600507,"data":"       |     # compute E: point on AC at distance CE = c_seg from C towards A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497601751,"data":"       |     # vector from C to A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497602881,"data":"       |     vx = (A[0] - C[0]) / b\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497604034,"data":"       |     vy = (A[1] - C[1]) / b\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497605441,"data":"       |     E = (C[0] + vx * c_seg, C[1] + vy * c_seg)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497606837,"data":"       |     # line EF: we can represent as point + direction\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497608041,"data":"       |     # compute projection of D onto line EF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497609201,"data":"       |     D = (float(d), 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497610319,"data":"       |     # projection formula\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497612949,"data":"       |     # vector from E to F\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497614159,"data":"       |     ex, ey = E\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497615307,"data":"       |     fx, fy = F\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497616478,"data":"       |     # direction vector\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497617661,"data":"       |     dx = fx - ex\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497618798,"data":"       |     dy = fy - ey\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497619914,"data":"       |     # vector from E to D\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497621064,"data":"       |     exd = D[0] - ex\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497622224,"data":"       |     eyd = D[1] - ey\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497623365,"data":"       |     # projection scalar t = (ED·EF) / |EF|^2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497624591,"data":"       |     t = (exd * dx + eyd * dy) / (dx*dx + dy*dy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497625758,"data":"       |     N = (ex + t * dx, ey + t * dy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497626939,"data":"       |     # circumcenter O of ABC\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497628094,"data":"       |     # O = (a/2, (xA^2 - a*xA + yA^2) / (2*yA))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497629278,"data":"       |     O = (a/2.0, (xA**2 - a*xA + yA**2) / (2*yA))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497630464,"data":"       |     # radius R\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497631575,"data":"       |     R = math.hypot(O[0] - B[0], O[1] - B[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497632775,"data":"       |     # circumcenter O2 of AFE\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497633974,"data":"       |     # Compute using perpendicular bisectors of AF and AE\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497635208,"data":"       |     # Midpoint of AF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497636379,"data":"       |     mx1 = (A[0] + F[0]) / 2.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497637521,"data":"       |     my1 = (A[1] + F[1]) / 2.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497638684,"data":"       |     # slope of AF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497639819,"data":"       |     # direction AF = (F - A)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497640968,"data":"       |     dx1 = F[0] - A[0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497642137,"data":"       |     dy1 = F[1] - A[1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497643251,"data":"       |     # perpendicular direction to AF is (-dy1, dx1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497644455,"data":"       |     # Similarly for AE\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497645618,"data":"       |     mx2 = (A[0] + E[0]) / 2.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497646765,"data":"       |     my2 = (A[1] + E[1]) / 2.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497647947,"data":"       |     dx2 = E[0] - A[0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497649101,"data":"       |     dy2 = E[1] - A[1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497650259,"data":"       |     # Solve intersection of lines: (mx1, my1) + t1*(-dy1, dx1) = (mx2, my2) + t2*(-dy2, dx2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497651525,"data":"       |     # Solve linear equations for t1,t2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497652714,"data":"       |     # Set up matrix\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497653851,"data":"       |     # (-dy1) * t1 + dy2 * t2 = mx2 - mx1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497655034,"data":"       |     # (dx1) * t1 - dx2 * t2 = my2 - my1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497657617,"data":"       |     # Solve for t1,t2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497658864,"data":"       |     A_mat = [[-dy1, dy2], [dx1, -dx2]]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497660045,"data":"       |     B_vec = [mx2 - mx1, my2 - my1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497661208,"data":"       |     # Solve linear system\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497662384,"data":"       |     det = A_mat[0][0]*A_mat[1][1] - A_mat[0][1]*A_mat[1][0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497663594,"data":"       |     if abs(det) \u003c 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497664817,"data":"       |         # degenerate\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497666157,"data":"       |         raise ValueError(\"Degenerate circumcenter\")\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497667459,"data":"       |     t1 = (B_vec[0]*A_mat[1][1] - B_vec[1]*A_mat[0][1]) / det\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497668675,"data":"       |     # Compute O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497669814,"data":"       |     O2 = (mx1 + t1 * (-dy1), my1 + t1 * dx1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497671012,"data":"       |     # radius R2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497672135,"data":"       |     R2 = math.hypot(O2[0] - A[0], O2[1] - A[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497673314,"data":"       |     # Compute K as reflection of A across line O-O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497674519,"data":"       |     # line through O and O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497675717,"data":"       |     # reflect point A across line defined by two points O and O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497676939,"data":"       |     # Use formula for reflection\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497678099,"data":"       |     # vector from O to O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497679291,"data":"       |     ox, oy = O\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497680431,"data":"       |     o2x, o2y = O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497681574,"data":"       |     # direction vector\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497682715,"data":"       |     vx_line = o2x - ox\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497683921,"data":"       |     vy_line = o2y - oy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497685095,"data":"       |     # normalize direction\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497686277,"data":"       |     norm2 = vx_line*vx_line + vy_line*vy_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497687465,"data":"       |     if norm2 == 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497688614,"data":"       |         raise ValueError(\"O and O2 coincide\")\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497689847,"data":"       |     # projection of (A - O) onto line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497691012,"data":"       |     ax, ay = A[0] - ox, A[1] - oy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497692197,"data":"       |     proj = (ax*vx_line + ay*vy_line) / norm2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497693381,"data":"       |     # foot of perpendicular from A to line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497694569,"data":"       |     foot_x = ox + proj * vx_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497695715,"data":"       |     foot_y = oy + proj * vy_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497696894,"data":"       |     # reflection: K = foot*2 - A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497698067,"data":"       |     K = (2*foot_x - A[0], 2*foot_y - A[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497699254,"data":"       |     # Compute K' as reflection of K across line EF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497702187,"data":"       |     # line EF defined by points E and F\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497703399,"data":"       |     ex, ey = E\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497704535,"data":"       |     fx, fy = F\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497705704,"data":"       |     # direction vector of EF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497706874,"data":"       |     ux_line = fx - ex\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497708061,"data":"       |     uy_line = fy - ey\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497709191,"data":"       |     norm2_ef = ux_line*ux_line + uy_line*uy_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497710369,"data":"       |     # reflect point K across line through E,F\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497711577,"data":"       |     kx, ky = K\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497712684,"data":"       |     # vector from E to K\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497713848,"data":"       |     vxk = kx - ex\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497715039,"data":"       |     vyk = ky - ey\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497716158,"data":"       |     proj_k = (vxk*ux_line + vyk*uy_line) / norm2_ef\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497717397,"data":"       |     foot_kx = ex + proj_k * ux_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497718544,"data":"       |     foot_ky = ey + proj_k * uy_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497719687,"data":"       |     Kprime = (2*foot_kx - kx, 2*foot_ky - ky)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497720852,"data":"       |     # Compute circumcircle of K,N,B\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497722025,"data":"       |     # Use three points to compute circumcenter\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497723247,"data":"       |     # function to compute circumcenter of three points\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497724775,"data":"       |     def circumcenter(P, Q, R):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497725952,"data":"       |         # returns (cx, cy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497727091,"data":"       |         (x1,y1),(x2,y2),(x3,y3) = P, Q, R\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497728275,"data":"       |         d = 2*(x1*(y2-y3) + x2*(y3-y1) + x3*(y1-y2))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497729494,"data":"       |         if abs(d) \u003c 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497730671,"data":"       |             raise ValueError(\"Collinear points\")\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497731984,"data":"       |         ux = ((x1**2 + y1**2)*(y2-y3) + (x2**2 + y2**2)*(y3-y1) + (x3**2 + y3**2)*(y1-y2)) / d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497733299,"data":"       |         uy = ((x1**2 + y1**2)*(x3-x2) + (x2**2 + y2**2)*(x1-x3) + (x3**2 + y3**2)*(x2-x1)) / d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497734614,"data":"       |         return (ux, uy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497735751,"data":"       |     try:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497736879,"data":"       |         O_KNB = circumcenter(K, N, B)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497738057,"data":"       |     except ValueError:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497739218,"data":"       |         O_KNB = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497740364,"data":"       |     # radius\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497741484,"data":"       |     if O_KNB:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497742641,"data":"       |         r_KNB = math.hypot(K[0] - O_KNB[0], K[1] - O_KNB[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497743924,"data":"       |         # cyclic condition: distance from O_KNB to Kprime equals r_KNB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497746704,"data":"       |         cyclic_val = math.hypot(Kprime[0] - O_KNB[0], Kprime[1] - O_KNB[1]) - r_KNB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497748081,"data":"       |     else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497749285,"data":"       |         cyclic_val = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497750491,"data":"       |     # Compute T: circle through B and K tangent to BN at B\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497751724,"data":"       |     # line BN\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497752841,"data":"       |     # compute unit direction of BN\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497754011,"data":"       |     # line BN direction vector\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497755201,"data":"       |     bn_dx = N[0] - B[0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497756328,"data":"       |     bn_dy = N[1] - B[1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497757479,"data":"       |     # perpendicular line at B: direction perpendicular to BN: (-bn_dy, bn_dx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497758781,"data":"       |     # find intersection of this line with perpendicular bisector of BK\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497760055,"data":"       |     # perpendicular bisector of BK passes through midpoint M_BK and direction perpendicular to BK\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497761364,"data":"       |     # direction of BK\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497762482,"data":"       |     bk_dx = K[0] - B[0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497763667,"data":"       |     bk_dy = K[1] - B[1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497765461,"data":"       |     # midpoint M_BK\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497766599,"data":"       |     M_BK = ((B[0] + K[0])/2.0, (B[1] + K[1])/2.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497767807,"data":"       |     # direction of perpendicular bisector is (-bk_dy, bk_dx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497769042,"data":"       |     # Solve intersection of two lines:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497770229,"data":"       |     # line1: B + s * (-bn_dy, bn_dx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497771385,"data":"       |     # line2: M_BK + t * (-bk_dy, bk_dx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497772594,"data":"       |     # Solve for s,t\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497773722,"data":"       |     # B + s * v1 = M_BK + t * v2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497774899,"data":"       |     v1x, v1y = -bn_dy, bn_dx\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497776095,"data":"       |     v2x, v2y = -bk_dy, bk_dx\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497777509,"data":"       |     # Solve linear equations:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497778644,"data":"       |     # s*v1x - t*v2x = M_BK.x - B.x\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497779792,"data":"       |     # s*v1y - t*v2y = M_BK.y - B.y\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497780948,"data":"       |     A_mat = [[v1x, -v2x], [v1y, -v2y]]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497782095,"data":"       |     B_vec = [M_BK[0] - B[0], M_BK[1] - B[1]]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497783294,"data":"       |     det = A_mat[0][0]*A_mat[1][1] - A_mat[0][1]*A_mat[1][0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497784541,"data":"       |     if abs(det) \u003c 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497785704,"data":"       |         O_T = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497786841,"data":"       |     else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497787958,"data":"       |         s_param = (B_vec[0]*A_mat[1][1] - B_vec[1]*A_mat[0][1]) / det\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497790984,"data":"       |         # compute O_T\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497792161,"data":"       |         O_T = (B[0] + s_param * v1x, B[1] + s_param * v1y)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497793402,"data":"       |     # radius r_T\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497802341,"data":"       |     if O_T:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497803552,"data":"       |         r_T = math.hypot(O_T[0] - B[0], O_T[1] - B[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497804752,"data":"       |         # Intersection of circle with BC (y=0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497805915,"data":"       |         # Solve (x - O_T.x)^2 + (0 - O_T.y)^2 = r_T^2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497807145,"data":"       |         # =\u003e (x - O_T.x)^2 = r_T^2 - O_T.y^2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497808361,"data":"       |         disc = r_T**2 - O_T[1]**2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497809514,"data":"       |         if disc \u003c -1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497810712,"data":"       |             T = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497811848,"data":"       |         else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497813002,"data":"       |             disc = max(disc, 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497814132,"data":"       |             sqrt_disc = math.sqrt(disc)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497815301,"data":"       |             x1 = O_T[0] + sqrt_disc\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497816438,"data":"       |             x2 = O_T[0] - sqrt_disc\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497817594,"data":"       |             # Choose the one not equal to B.x=0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497818769,"data":"       |             if abs(x1) \u003e 1e-9:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497819954,"data":"       |                 T = (x1, 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497821127,"data":"       |             else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497822259,"data":"       |                 T = (x2, 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497823414,"data":"       |     else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497824529,"data":"       |         T = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497825639,"data":"       |     # Compute ratio R = (CT * NB) / (BT * NE)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497826822,"data":"       |     if T:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497827925,"data":"       |         CT = math.hypot(C[0] - T[0], C[1] - T[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497829111,"data":"       |         BT = math.hypot(B[0] - T[0], B[1] - T[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497830301,"data":"       |         NB = math.hypot(N[0] - B[0], N[1] - B[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497831535,"data":"       |         NE = math.hypot(N[0] - E[0], N[1] - E[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497832728,"data":"       |         ratio = (CT * NB) / (BT * NE)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497833895,"data":"       |     else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497835029,"data":"       |         ratio = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497836164,"data":"       |     return {\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497837289,"data":"       |         'a': a, 'b': b, 'c': c, 's': s,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497838451,"data":"       |         'A': A, 'B': B, 'C': C,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497839625,"data":"       |         'I': I,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497842742,"data":"       |         'E': E, 'F': F,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497843914,"data":"       |         'D': D, 'N': N,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497845087,"data":"       |         'K': K, 'Kprime': Kprime,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497846567,"data":"       |         'cyclic_val': cyclic_val,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497847735,"data":"       |         'ratio': ratio,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497848897,"data":"       |         'O_T': O_T,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497850072,"data":"       |         'T': T,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497851255,"data":"       |     }\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497852431,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497853514,"data":"       | def find_s_for_n(n, s_guess_factor=1.2):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497854687,"data":"       |     a = fibonacci(n+2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497855854,"data":"       |     # s must be \u003e a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497857061,"data":"       |     # Use binary search or root find for cyclic_val = 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497858259,"data":"       |     # We'll search s in [a+epsilon, large]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497859491,"data":"       |     # Let's try to find root using simple method: use bisection on interval [a+1e-6, a*10] maybe.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497860784,"data":"       |     lo = a + 1e-6\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497861951,"data":"       |     hi = a * 10 + 10\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497863077,"data":"       |     # compute cyclic_val at lo and hi\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497864254,"data":"       |     def cyclic_at(s):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497865397,"data":"       |         data = triangle_data(n, s)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497866547,"data":"       |         return data['cyclic_val']\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497867698,"data":"       |     f_lo = cyclic_at(lo)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497868864,"data":"       |     f_hi = cyclic_at(hi)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497870001,"data":"       |     # We need sign change\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497871164,"data":"       |     # If not, increase hi\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497872321,"data":"       |     iter_expand = 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497873449,"data":"       |     while f_lo * f_hi \u003e 0 and iter_expand \u003c 20:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497874744,"data":"       |         hi *= 2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497875861,"data":"       |         f_hi = cyclic_at(hi)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497877015,"data":"       |         iter_expand += 1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497878184,"data":"       |     if f_lo * f_hi \u003e 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497879369,"data":"       |         # No sign change, maybe root not in interval\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497880615,"data":"       |         # Return None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497881777,"data":"       |         return None, None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497882932,"data":"       |     # Bisection\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497884048,"data":"       |     for _ in range(60):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497885174,"data":"       |         mid = (lo + hi) / 2.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497886321,"data":"       |         f_mid = cyclic_at(mid)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497889289,"data":"       |         if f_mid == 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497890477,"data":"       |             lo = hi = mid\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497891679,"data":"       |             break\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497892827,"data":"       |         if f_lo * f_mid \u003c= 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497894012,"data":"       |             hi = mid\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497895155,"data":"       |             f_hi = f_mid\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497896357,"data":"       |         else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497897489,"data":"       |             lo = mid\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497898637,"data":"       |             f_lo = f_mid\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497899788,"data":"       |     s_root = (lo + hi) / 2.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497900964,"data":"       |     data_root = triangle_data(n, s_root)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497902141,"data":"       |     return s_root, data_root['ratio']\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497903359,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497904488,"data":"       | # Test for n=4\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497905608,"data":"       | s_root, ratio = find_s_for_n(4)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497906785,"data":"       | s_root, ratio\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497907927,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497909027,"data":"     [Code] [ERROR]:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497910204,"data":"       | import math\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497911349,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497912449,"data":"       | def triangle_data(n, s):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497913621,"data":"       |     # returns dictionary of geometric quantities for given n and semiperimeter s\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497915107,"data":"       |     # n integer, s \u003e a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497916276,"data":"       |     a = fibonacci(n+2)  # BC\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497917429,"data":"       |     d = fibonacci(n)    # BD\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497918585,"data":"       |     c_seg = fibonacci(n+1)  # CD\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497919801,"data":"       |     # side lengths\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497920945,"data":"       |     b = s - d   # CA\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497922085,"data":"       |     c = s - c_seg  # AB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497923254,"data":"       |     # check positivity\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497924385,"data":"       |     if b \u003c= 0 or c \u003c= 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497925637,"data":"       |         raise ValueError(\"Invalid s\")\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497926874,"data":"       |     # coordinates\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497928065,"data":"       |     # x_A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497929379,"data":"       |     xA = (c**2 - b**2 + a**2) / (2*a)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497930554,"data":"       |     # y_A from area formula: using Heron\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497931735,"data":"       |     s_val = s\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497932894,"data":"       |     # area using Heron\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497934216,"data":"       |     area = math.sqrt(s_val * (s_val - a) * (s_val - b) * (s_val - c))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497937035,"data":"       |     yA = 2 * area / a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497938224,"data":"       |     # Points\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497939374,"data":"       |     B = (0.0, 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497940688,"data":"       |     C = (float(a), 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497941834,"data":"       |     A = (xA, yA)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497942974,"data":"       |     # incircle center I = (d, r)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497944137,"data":"       |     r = area / s_val\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497945281,"data":"       |     I = (float(d), r)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497946475,"data":"       |     # compute F: point on AB at distance BF = d from B along AB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497947709,"data":"       |     # AB length = c\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497948857,"data":"       |     # unit vector from B to A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497950037,"data":"       |     ux = (A[0] - B[0]) / c\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497951199,"data":"       |     uy = (A[1] - B[1]) / c\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497952371,"data":"       |     F = (B[0] + ux * d, B[1] + uy * d)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497953551,"data":"       |     # compute E: point on AC at distance CE = c_seg from C towards A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497954776,"data":"       |     # vector from C to A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497955934,"data":"       |     vx = (A[0] - C[0]) / b\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497957077,"data":"       |     vy = (A[1] - C[1]) / b\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497958219,"data":"       |     E = (C[0] + vx * c_seg, C[1] + vy * c_seg)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497959426,"data":"       |     # line EF: we can represent as point + direction\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497960625,"data":"       |     # compute projection of D onto line EF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497961841,"data":"       |     D = (float(d), 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497962957,"data":"       |     # projection formula\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497964106,"data":"       |     # vector from E to F\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497965261,"data":"       |     ex, ey = E\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497966379,"data":"       |     fx, fy = F\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497967527,"data":"       |     # direction vector\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497968717,"data":"       |     dx = fx - ex\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497969859,"data":"       |     dy = fy - ey\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497970995,"data":"       |     # vector from E to D\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497972166,"data":"       |     exd = D[0] - ex\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497973321,"data":"       |     eyd = D[1] - ey\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497974468,"data":"       |     # projection scalar t = (ED·EF) / |EF|^2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497975684,"data":"       |     t = (exd * dx + eyd * dy) / (dx*dx + dy*dy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497976854,"data":"       |     N = (ex + t * dx, ey + t * dy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497978037,"data":"       |     # circumcenter O of ABC\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497979236,"data":"       |     # O = (a/2, (xA^2 - a*xA + yA^2) / (2*yA))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497980699,"data":"       |     O = (a/2.0, (xA**2 - a*xA + yA**2) / (2*yA))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497984544,"data":"       |     # radius R\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497985679,"data":"       |     R = math.hypot(O[0] - B[0], O[1] - B[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497986867,"data":"       |     # circumcenter O2 of AFE\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497988071,"data":"       |     # Compute using perpendicular bisectors of AF and AE\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497989321,"data":"       |     # Midpoint of AF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497990476,"data":"       |     mx1 = (A[0] + F[0]) / 2.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497991627,"data":"       |     my1 = (A[1] + F[1]) / 2.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497992801,"data":"       |     # slope of AF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497993938,"data":"       |     # direction AF = (F - A)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497995131,"data":"       |     dx1 = F[0] - A[0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497996285,"data":"       |     dy1 = F[1] - A[1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497997414,"data":"       |     # perpendicular direction to AF is (-dy1, dx1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497998618,"data":"       |     # Similarly for AE\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.497999771,"data":"       |     mx2 = (A[0] + E[0]) / 2.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498000931,"data":"       |     my2 = (A[1] + E[1]) / 2.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498002109,"data":"       |     dx2 = E[0] - A[0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498003254,"data":"       |     dy2 = E[1] - A[1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498004419,"data":"       |     # Solve intersection of lines: (mx1, my1) + t1*(-dy1, dx1) = (mx2, my2) + t2*(-dy2, dx2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498005697,"data":"       |     # Solve linear equations for t1,t2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498006889,"data":"       |     # Set up matrix\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498008056,"data":"       |     # (-dy1) * t1 + dy2 * t2 = mx2 - mx1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498009257,"data":"       |     # (dx1) * t1 - dx2 * t2 = my2 - my1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498010436,"data":"       |     # Solve for t1,t2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498011561,"data":"       |     A_mat = [[-dy1, dy2], [dx1, -dx2]]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498012744,"data":"       |     B_vec = [mx2 - mx1, my2 - my1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498013901,"data":"       |     # Solve linear system\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498015066,"data":"       |     det = A_mat[0][0]*A_mat[1][1] - A_mat[0][1]*A_mat[1][0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498016264,"data":"       |     if abs(det) \u003c 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498017464,"data":"       |         # degenerate\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498018605,"data":"       |         raise ValueError(\"Degenerate circumcenter\")\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498019904,"data":"       |     t1 = (B_vec[0]*A_mat[1][1] - B_vec[1]*A_mat[0][1]) / det\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498021156,"data":"       |     # Compute O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498022269,"data":"       |     O2 = (mx1 + t1 * (-dy1), my1 + t1 * dx1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498023467,"data":"       |     # radius R2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498024594,"data":"       |     R2 = math.hypot(O2[0] - A[0], O2[1] - A[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498025781,"data":"       |     # Compute K as reflection of A across line O-O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498029079,"data":"       |     # line through O and O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498030294,"data":"       |     # reflect point A across line defined by two points O and O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498031529,"data":"       |     # Use formula for reflection\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498032679,"data":"       |     # vector from O to O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498033854,"data":"       |     ox, oy = O\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498034997,"data":"       |     o2x, o2y = O2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498036154,"data":"       |     # direction vector\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498037306,"data":"       |     vx_line = o2x - ox\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498038464,"data":"       |     vy_line = o2y - oy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498039611,"data":"       |     # normalize direction\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498040964,"data":"       |     norm2 = vx_line*vx_line + vy_line*vy_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498042197,"data":"       |     if norm2 == 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498043357,"data":"       |         raise ValueError(\"O and O2 coincide\")\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498044602,"data":"       |     # projection of (A - O) onto line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498045761,"data":"       |     ax, ay = A[0] - ox, A[1] - oy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498046915,"data":"       |     proj = (ax*vx_line + ay*vy_line) / norm2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498048121,"data":"       |     # foot of perpendicular from A to line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498049335,"data":"       |     foot_x = ox + proj * vx_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498050505,"data":"       |     foot_y = oy + proj * vy_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498051671,"data":"       |     # reflection: K = foot*2 - A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498052821,"data":"       |     K = (2*foot_x - A[0], 2*foot_y - A[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498053998,"data":"       |     # Compute K' as reflection of K across line EF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498055195,"data":"       |     # line EF defined by points E and F\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498056391,"data":"       |     ex, ey = E\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498057512,"data":"       |     fx, fy = F\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498058687,"data":"       |     # direction vector of EF\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498059845,"data":"       |     ux_line = fx - ex\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498061011,"data":"       |     uy_line = fy - ey\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498062127,"data":"       |     norm2_ef = ux_line*ux_line + uy_line*uy_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498063302,"data":"       |     # reflect point K across line through E,F\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498064494,"data":"       |     kx, ky = K\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498065629,"data":"       |     # vector from E to K\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498066781,"data":"       |     vxk = kx - ex\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498067962,"data":"       |     vyk = ky - ey\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498069085,"data":"       |     proj_k = (vxk*ux_line + vyk*uy_line) / norm2_ef\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498070289,"data":"       |     foot_kx = ex + proj_k * ux_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498071451,"data":"       |     foot_ky = ey + proj_k * uy_line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498074366,"data":"       |     Kprime = (2*foot_kx - kx, 2*foot_ky - ky)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498075574,"data":"       |     # Compute circumcircle of K,N,B\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498076755,"data":"       |     # Use three points to compute circumcenter\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498077965,"data":"       |     # function to compute circumcenter of three points\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498079219,"data":"       |     def circumcenter(P, Q, R):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498080377,"data":"       |         # returns (cx, cy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498081527,"data":"       |         (x1,y1),(x2,y2),(x3,y3) = P, Q, R\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498082725,"data":"       |         d = 2*(x1*(y2-y3) + x2*(y3-y1) + x3*(y1-y2))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498083935,"data":"       |         if abs(d) \u003c 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498085152,"data":"       |             raise ValueError(\"Collinear points\")\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498086457,"data":"       |         ux = ((x1**2 + y1**2)*(y2-y3) + (x2**2 + y2**2)*(y3-y1) + (x3**2 + y3**2)*(y1-y2)) / d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498087832,"data":"       |         uy = ((x1**2 + y1**2)*(x3-x2) + (x2**2 + y2**2)*(x1-x3) + (x3**2 + y3**2)*(x2-x1)) / d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498089704,"data":"       |         return (ux, uy)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498090852,"data":"       |     try:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498091994,"data":"       |         O_KNB = circumcenter(K, N, B)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498093171,"data":"       |     except ValueError:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498094321,"data":"       |         O_KNB = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498095469,"data":"       |     # radius\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498096604,"data":"       |     if O_KNB:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498097985,"data":"       |         r_KNB = math.hypot(K[0] - O_KNB[0], K[1] - O_KNB[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498099284,"data":"       |         # cyclic condition: distance from O_KNB to Kprime equals r_KNB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498100546,"data":"       |         cyclic_val = math.hypot(Kprime[0] - O_KNB[0], Kprime[1] - O_KNB[1]) - r_KNB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498101804,"data":"       |     else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498102927,"data":"       |         cyclic_val = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498104084,"data":"       |     # Compute T: circle through B and K tangent to BN at B\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498105325,"data":"       |     # line BN\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498106445,"data":"       |     # compute unit direction of BN\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498107615,"data":"       |     # line BN direction vector\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498108834,"data":"       |     bn_dx = N[0] - B[0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498109972,"data":"       |     bn_dy = N[1] - B[1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498111124,"data":"       |     # perpendicular line at B: direction perpendicular to BN: (-bn_dy, bn_dx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498112386,"data":"       |     # find intersection of this line with perpendicular bisector of BK\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498113664,"data":"       |     # perpendicular bisector of BK passes through midpoint M_BK and direction perpendicular to BK\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498116704,"data":"       |     # direction of BK\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498117878,"data":"       |     bk_dx = K[0] - B[0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498119025,"data":"       |     bk_dy = K[1] - B[1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498120225,"data":"       |     # midpoint M_BK\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498121379,"data":"       |     M_BK = ((B[0] + K[0])/2.0, (B[1] + K[1])/2.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498122604,"data":"       |     # direction of perpendicular bisector is (-bk_dy, bk_dx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498123819,"data":"       |     # Solve intersection of two lines:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498124994,"data":"       |     # line1: B + s * (-bn_dy, bn_dx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498126149,"data":"       |     # line2: M_BK + t * (-bk_dy, bk_dx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498127327,"data":"       |     # Solve for s,t\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498128456,"data":"       |     # B + s * v1 = M_BK + t * v2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498129631,"data":"       |     v1x, v1y = -bn_dy, bn_dx\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498130777,"data":"       |     v2x, v2y = -bk_dy, bk_dx\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498131937,"data":"       |     # Solve linear equations:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498133067,"data":"       |     # s*v1x - t*v2x = M_BK.x - B.x\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498134221,"data":"       |     # s*v1y - t*v2y = M_BK.y - B.y\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498135372,"data":"       |     A_mat = [[v1x, -v2x], [v1y, -v2y]]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498136515,"data":"       |     B_vec = [M_BK[0] - B[0], M_BK[1] - B[1]]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498137724,"data":"       |     det = A_mat[0][0]*A_mat[1][1] - A_mat[0][1]*A_mat[1][0]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498138969,"data":"       |     if abs(det) \u003c 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498140131,"data":"       |         O_T = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498141281,"data":"       |     else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498142411,"data":"       |         s_param = (B_vec[0]*A_mat[1][1] - B_vec[1]*A_mat[0][1]) / det\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498143647,"data":"       |         # compute O_T\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498144774,"data":"       |         O_T = (B[0] + s_param * v1x, B[1] + s_param * v1y)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498145987,"data":"       |     # radius r_T\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498147121,"data":"       |     if O_T:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498148251,"data":"       |         r_T = math.hypot(O_T[0] - B[0], O_T[1] - B[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498149484,"data":"       |         # Intersection of circle with BC (y=0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498150906,"data":"       |         # Solve (x - O_T.x)^2 + (0 - O_T.y)^2 = r_T^2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498152116,"data":"       |         # =\u003e (x - O_T.x)^2 = r_T^2 - O_T.y^2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498153354,"data":"       |         disc = r_T**2 - O_T[1]**2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498154509,"data":"       |         if disc \u003c -1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498155705,"data":"       |             T = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498156889,"data":"       |         else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498158022,"data":"       |             disc = max(disc, 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498160889,"data":"       |             sqrt_disc = math.sqrt(disc)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498162106,"data":"       |             x1 = O_T[0] + sqrt_disc\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498163285,"data":"       |             x2 = O_T[0] - sqrt_disc\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498164465,"data":"       |             # Choose the one not equal to B.x=0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498165661,"data":"       |             if abs(x1) \u003e 1e-9:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498166857,"data":"       |                 T = (x1, 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498168079,"data":"       |             else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498169238,"data":"       |                 T = (x2, 0.0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498170396,"data":"       |     else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498171529,"data":"       |         T = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498172659,"data":"       |     # Compute ratio R = (CT * NB) / (BT * NE)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498173857,"data":"       |     if T:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498174984,"data":"       |         CT = math.hypot(C[0] - T[0], C[1] - T[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498176177,"data":"       |         BT = math.hypot(B[0] - T[0], B[1] - T[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498177404,"data":"       |         NB = math.hypot(N[0] - B[0], N[1] - B[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498178628,"data":"       |         NE = math.hypot(N[0] - E[0], N[1] - E[1])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498179821,"data":"       |         ratio = (CT * NB) / (BT * NE)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498181021,"data":"       |     else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498182158,"data":"       |         ratio = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498183308,"data":"       |     return {\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498184421,"data":"       |         'a': a, 'b': b, 'c': c, 's': s,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498185598,"data":"       |         'A': A, 'B': B, 'C': C,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498186761,"data":"       |         'I': I,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498187931,"data":"       |         'E': E, 'F': F,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498189067,"data":"       |         'D': D, 'N': N,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498190177,"data":"       |         'K': K, 'Kprime': Kprime,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498191359,"data":"       |         'cyclic_val': cyclic_val,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498192527,"data":"       |         'ratio': ratio,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498193674,"data":"       |         'O_T': O_T,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498194824,"data":"       |         'T': T,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498195964,"data":"       |     }\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498197141,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498198208,"data":"       | def find_s_for_n(n, s_guess_factor=1.2):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498199387,"data":"       |     a = fibonacci(n+2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498200525,"data":"       |     # s must be \u003e a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498201727,"data":"       |     # Use binary search or root find for cyclic_val = 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498202906,"data":"       |     # We'll search s in [a+epsilon, large]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498204109,"data":"       |     # Let's try to find root using simple method: use bisection on interval [a+1e-6, a*10] maybe.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498207051,"data":"       |     lo = a + 1e-6\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2711.498208237,"data":"       |     hi = a * 10 + 10\n"}
