,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.169434343,"data":"       | - $\\alpha(m) = 0$ for all integers $m \u003c 0$ and $m \u003e 8$. So support is within [0,8] inclusive. So $\\alpha$ is a finite sequence of length 9 (positions 0-8) possibly zero elsewhere.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.169436075,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.169437243,"data":"       | - There exists $\\beta \\in \\mathcal{F}$ and integers $k \\neq l$ such that for all $n \\in \\mathbb{Z}$,\n"}
