,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.172181752,"data":"       | This is reminiscent of constructing a sequence whose autocorrelation (or cross-correlation) yields a given pattern; essentially we need $\\alpha$ to be a \"difference set\"? Actually we have two ones; maybe we can think of $\\alpha$ as a \"binary\" sequence? But entries can be any integers, not just 0/1.\n"}
