,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.172207243,"data":"       | Because $\\beta$ can be any integer-valued finite support function, we can adjust to satisfy linear equations. For a given $\\alpha$, we need to find $\\beta$ and k,l such that the linear equations hold.\n"}
