,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.172217154,"data":"       | This is reminiscent of solving a linear system: we have unknown vector $\\beta$ (maybe of length m) and unknown shift positions k,l. The convolution equations are linear in $\\beta$; we can treat k,l as parameters.\n"}
