,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.172253135,"data":"       | Since a has length 9, the mapping from b to c is linear with rank at most 9 (since each c_n is linear combination of at most 9 b's). Actually each c_n uses b_{i-n} for i=0..8, i.e., b_{-n} to b_{8-n}. So sliding window of length 9.\n"}
