,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.17228628,"data":"       | But note that A(x) is a polynomial (no negative powers) with degree ≤8 and constant term a_0 may be zero? Could be zero. But we need A(x) to be a factor of x^k + x^l.\n"}
