,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173279161,"data":"       | analysisProblem: beta_rev_expr may contain negative powers, which sympy's Poly cannot handle. We need to treat as Laurent polynomial manually.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173280643,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173281785,"data":"       | Simplify: Since beta_rev(x) = x^{-m} * Q(x), where Q is polynomial with nonnegative exponents. So beta_rev(x) = sum_{j=0}^{deg(Q)} q_j x^{j-m}. So exponent range from -m to deg(Q)-m. So we can extract coefficients accordingly.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173283359,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173284882,"data":"       | Thus we can compute b_j = coefficient of x^{-j} in beta_rev(x). That's the coefficient of x^{ -j } = x^{ -j }. So we need to map exponent e to j = -e. So we can compute dictionary of coefficients for each exponent e.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173288332,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173289525,"data":"       | Implementation: Use sp.Poly(Q_expr, x) to get coefficients q_j. Then for each j, exponent in beta_rev is j - m. So coefficient for exponent e = j - m is q_j. So b_{-e} = coefficient for exponent e. So we can compute b(k) = coefficient for exponent e = -k. So b(k) = q_{k+m} if k+m between 0 and deg(Q). Actually we can compute directly: b(k) = coefficient of x^{ -k } in beta_rev = coefficient of x^{ -k + m } in Q(x). Since Q(x) has only nonnegative exponents, we need -k + m \u003e= 0 =\u003e k \u003c= m. So b(k) is zero for k \u003e m. For k \u003c= m, b(k) = coefficient of x^{m - k} in Q(x). Good.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173291953,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173293067,"data":"       | Thus we can compute convolution using this.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173294333,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173295442,"data":"       | Let's implement verify again.assistantanalysis to=python codedef verify_alpha(alpha_poly):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173296776,"data":"       |     # alpha_poly: sympy Poly with integer coefficients, support exponents \u003e=0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173298081,"data":"       |     # Determine m = min exponent\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173299298,"data":"       |     monoms = alpha_poly.as_dict()\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.17330049,"data":"       |     m = min(exp[0] for exp in monoms)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173301659,"data":"       |     # Compute P = x^{-m} * alpha\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173302839,"data":"       |     P_expr = sp.expand(alpha_poly.as_expr() / x**m)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173304105,"data":"       |     P_poly = sp.Poly(P_expr, x, domain=sp.ZZ)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173305337,"data":"       |     # Determine tset: which t in t_list have Φ_{2t} dividing P\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173306656,"data":"       |     tset = []\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173307816,"data":"       |     for t in t_list:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173309018,"data":"       |         phi_poly = sp.cyclotomic_poly(2*t, x, polys=True)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173310251,"data":"       |         # check divisibility\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173311526,"data":"       |         if sp.rem(P_poly, phi_poly) == 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173312696,"data":"       |             tset.append(t)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173313937,"data":"       |     # Compute d\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173315091,"data":"       |     if tset:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173316216,"data":"       |         d = lcm_list(tset)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173317395,"data":"       |     else:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173318525,"data":"       |         # choose d \u003e m, e.g., m+1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173319777,"data":"       |         d = m + 1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173320916,"data":"       |     # Compute Q = (x^d + 1) // P\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173322111,"data":"       |     quotient, remainder = sp.div(x**d + 1, P_expr, domain=sp.ZZ)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173323418,"data":"       |     if remainder != 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.17332503,"data":"       |         # division not exact\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173328713,"data":"       |         return False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173329935,"data":"       |     Q_expr = sp.expand(quotient)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173331124,"data":"       |     Q_poly = sp.Poly(Q_expr, x, domain=sp.ZZ)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173332332,"data":"       |     # Get coefficients of alpha\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173334357,"data":"       |     a = {exp[0]: coeff for exp, coeff in monoms.items()}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173335615,"data":"       |     # Define b(k) as described\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173336849,"data":"       |     # Q coefficients dict: exponent j -\u003e coeff q_j\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173338164,"data":"       |     q_coeff = {exp[0]: coeff for exp, coeff in Q_poly.as_dict().items()}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173339408,"data":"       |     max_q_exp = max(q_coeff.keys()) if q_coeff else -1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.17334063,"data":"       |     def b(k):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173341765,"data":"       |         # return coefficient b_k\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173342958,"data":"       |         # need coefficient of x^{m - k} in Q, if m - k in range\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173344195,"data":"       |         exp = m - k\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173345357,"data":"       |         if exp \u003c 0 or exp \u003e max_q_exp:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.17334668,"data":"       |             return 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.17334782,"data":"       |         return q_coeff.get(exp, 0)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173348973,"data":"       |     # Compute convolution c_n for n in range -5..d+5\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173350179,"data":"       |     for n in range(-5, d+6):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173351353,"data":"       |         s = 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173352469,"data":"       |         for i, a_i in a.items():\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.17335363,"data":"       |             s += a_i * b(i - n)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173354784,"data":"       |         expected = 1 if n in (0, d) else 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173356011,"data":"       |         if s != expected:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173357174,"data":"       |             # print mismatch\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173358347,"data":"       |             #print(\"alpha\", alpha_poly, \"n\", n, \"s\", s, \"expected\", expected)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173359868,"data":"       |             return False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.17336102,"data":"       |     return True\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173362183,"data":"       | \n"}
