,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.173715923,"data":"       | We need to pick d such that for each t in combo, t|d and d/t odd. We can compute d as LCM of t's times maybe an odd factor to make each quotient odd. Since all t have same v2, the LCM will have that same v2, and the quotient d/t will be odd (since LCM's odd part is the lcm of odd parts). So d = LCM of t's should satisfy condition.\n"}
