,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.174445773,"data":"       | Now we can also test for any α not in this list that might be shifty with larger coefficients maybe beyond our classification. Let's brute force search for α with coefficients in range -3..3 maybe, and see if any shifty not in our list.\n"}
