,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.174819184,"data":"       | Thus the cyclotomic factors have order of the form 2^{a+1} * d where d|m (odd). So they are all of order divisible by 2^{a+1}. So the degrees of these cyclotomic polynomials are φ(2^{a+1} d) = φ(2^{a+1}) φ(d) = 2^{a} φ(d). Since φ(2^{a+1}) = 2^{a}.\n"}
