,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.174944221,"data":"       | But note that φ(m) can be odd for m=1,2? Actually φ(1)=1, φ(2)=1, φ(3)=2, φ(4)=2, φ(5)=4, φ(6)=2, φ(7)=6, φ(8)=4, φ(9)=6, φ(10)=4, φ(12)=4, etc.\n"}
