,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.175766197,"data":"       | Now we need to list cyclotomic polynomials Φ_d for even d with degree ≤8 (since deg(D) ≤8). Also we need to consider possible e (the exponent of 2). Let's compute cyclotomic polynomials up to degree 8.\n"}
