,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.175777786,"data":"       | - n=6: φ=2, Φ_6(x) = x^2 - x + 1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.175778976,"data":"       | - n=8: φ=4, Φ_8(x) = x^4 + 1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.175780224,"data":"       | - n=10: φ=4, Φ_10(x) = x^4 - x^3 + x^2 - x + 1? Actually Φ_10(x) = x^4 - x^3 + x^2 - x + 1.\n"}
