,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.176089993,"data":"       | Thus we can enumerate D as: For each e, for each nonempty subset of cyclo_by_e[e], compute total degree sum, include if ≤L. Also include D=1 (empty). So N(L) = 1 + Σ_{e} (number of nonempty subsets of cyclo_by_e[e] with total degree ≤ L).\n"}
