,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.17636201,"data":"       | Now for e=2 (m with v2(m)=1), i.e., m even but not divisible by 4. Then 1 + x^m includes cyclotomic factors Φ_{2^{2} * odd divisor of m} (i.e., d = 4*odd). So the set includes Φ4 (d=4) and Φ_{12} (d=12) if odd divisor 3 divides m, etc. So any subset of those yields a divisor.\n"}
