,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.176508561,"data":"       | But we also need to present reasoning in a clear step-by-step solution.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.176509841,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.176510947,"data":"       | Let's craft a solution:\n"}
