,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.176549104,"data":"       | 10. For each shift r = 0,…,8 we have L = 8−r, so the number of admissible α with that r equals N(8−r). The sign of the whole polynomial may be chosen independently, giving a factor 2.\n"}
