,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.1766867,"data":"       | Also α must be zero for m\u003c0 and \u003e8, but within 0..8 any integer values allowed (including zero). However, α must be in F, so finite support; we already have support subset of [0,8], but could be zero on some interior positions.\n"}
