,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.176763223,"data":"       | Now, for each A(x) dividing some x^d + 1, its irreducible factors must be among those Φ_m where m = 2^{a+1} * t for some d with a = v_2(d) (the exponent of 2 in d) and t odd divisor of d_odd.\n"}
