,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.176768954,"data":"       | For m=4, need d such that 4|2d but 4∤d. That means 2d multiple of 4 =\u003e d even. And 4∤d =\u003e v2(d)=1. So choose d=2. Then x^2+1 = Φ_4. So m=4 possible.\n"}
