,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.177351354,"data":"       | But also note that we can combine subsets from different groups if we also adjust d? Not allowed because they would have different v2. So not allowed.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.177352784,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.177353894,"data":"       | Thus N = 1 (empty) + sum over groups of number of nonempty subsets with sum degree ≤8.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.177355229,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.177356382,"data":"       | But also we could consider subsets that are empty within each group but overall empty (already counted). So we can just count all subsets where all selected m have same v2.\n"}
