,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.177361442,"data":"       | We can compute this directly: iterate over all subsets, keep only those where selected v2 values are all equal (or subset empty). Count them. Let's compute.assistantanalysis to=python codedef v2(n):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.177362922,"data":"       |     cnt=0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.177364032,"data":"       |     while n%2==0:\n"}
