,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2937.183123251,"data":"       | analysisLet's decode these tuples: tuple (c0, c1, ..., c_deg). For example (1,1) corresponds to 1 + x. (1,0,1) corresponds to 1 + x^2. (1,-1,1) corresponds to 1 - x + x^2 (which is Φ_3). (1,0,0,1) corresponds to 1 + x^3? Actually 1 + x^3 = (x+1)(x^2 - x + 1) = (1 + x)*(1 - x + x^2). So (1,0,0,1) is 1 + x^3. Indeed.\n"}
