,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3009.224050045,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3009.224051169,"data":"       | Thus (1+i)^13 = 2^{13/2} * (-(1+i)/√2) = 2^{13/2} * -(1+i)/2^{1/2} = -2^{6} * (1+i) = -64 (1+i). Wait 2^{13/2} = 2^{6.5} = 2^6 * sqrt(2) = 64 * sqrt(2). Multiply by -(1+i)/sqrt(2) gives -64 (1+i). Good.\n"}
