,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3009.224056051,"data":"       | Thus (1+i)^13 - 1 = -64 (1+i) - 1 = -(64 + 64i + 1) = -(65 + 64i). Actually -64(1+i) - 1 = -64 -64i -1 = -(65 + 64i). Similarly (1-i)^13 - 1 = -64 (1-i) - 1 = -64 + 64i - 1 = -(65 - 64i). So product = (-(65+64i)) * (-(65-64i)) = (65+64i)(65-64i) = 65^2 + 64^2 = 4225 + 4096 = 8321. Good.\n"}
