,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3009.224232341,"data":"       | But we must verify that product over all 13th roots of unity indeed equals resultant, which we used. Let's double-check with direct computation using Python with complex numbers approximations to verify product.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3009.224233809,"data":"       | \n"}
