,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3009.224465011,"data":"       | Thus product over all 13th roots of unity of f(z). This is reminiscent of evaluating resultant of f(z) with z^13 - 1, i.e., product_{z: z^13=1} f(z) = resultant(z^13 - 1, f(z)) up to sign maybe.\n"}
