,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3009.224467632,"data":"       | Alternatively, we can compute directly using known factorization: For any polynomial g(z), product_{z: z^n=1} g(z) = resultant(z^n - 1, g(z)). Since resultant of two monic polynomials is integer.\n"}
