,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3009.224971824,"data":"       | Thus we need to compute β1, β2 = roots of x^2 - 2x + 2 = 0 =\u003e x = (2 ± sqrt(4 - 8))/2 = (2 ± sqrt(-4))/2 = (2 ± 2i)/2 = 1 ± i. So β1 = 1 + i, β2 = 1 - i.\n"}
