,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114156467,"data":"       | Thus we need to solve for t parameter along AM: Q = A + t*(M-A) where t ∈ [0,1] (since Q on segment from A (t=0) to M (t=1)). Actually A + λ*(M-A) where λ ∈ [0,1]. Let's param.\n"}
