,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114545371,"data":"       | Midpoint of AB: ((5+0)/2, (12+0)/2) = (2.5,6). Slope AB: (12-0)/(5-0)=12/5 =\u003e perpendicular slope = -5/12.\n"}
