,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114811269,"data":"       | analysisEquation reduces to factor 147*sqrt(37)/5476 times expression: 39*(74*s - 11)*sqrt(144*(s - 1)**2 + (2*s - 9)**2) - 5*(370*s + 99)*sqrt(144*(s - 1)**2 + (2*s + 5)**2) = 0.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114812702,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114813821,"data":"       | Simplify: 39*(74 s - 11) * sqrt(144 (s-1)^2 + (2s - 9)^2) = 5*(370 s + 99) * sqrt(144 (s-1)^2 + (2 s + 5)^2).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114815144,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114816217,"data":"       | Now we can solve for s.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114817314,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114818447,"data":"       | Let’s compute squares: define A1 = sqrt(144 (s-1)^2 + (2s - 9)^2). B1 = sqrt(144 (s-1)^2 + (2s + 5)^2).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114819762,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114820894,"data":"       | Note (s-1)^2 factor is common.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114822017,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114824697,"data":"       | Simplify squares:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114825824,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114826897,"data":"       | Compute (2s - 9)^2 = 4s^2 - 36s +81.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114828052,"data":"       | Compute (2s +5)^2 = 4s^2 +20s +25.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114829214,"data":"       | Compute 144 (s-1)^2 = 144 (s^2 -2s +1) = 144 s^2 -288 s +144.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114830405,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114831574,"data":"       | Thus A1^2 = 144 s^2 -288 s +144 + 4s^2 -36s +81 = (144+4)s^2 + (-288-36)s + (144+81) = 148 s^2 -324 s +225.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114832837,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114833922,"data":"       | Similarly B1^2 = 144 s^2 -288 s +144 + 4s^2 +20 s +25 = 148 s^2 -268 s +169.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114835131,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114836209,"data":"       | Thus A1 = sqrt(148 s^2 -324 s +225). B1 = sqrt(148 s^2 -268 s +169).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114837427,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114838491,"data":"       | Now equation: 39*(74 s - 11) * A1 = 5*(370 s + 99) * B1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114839668,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114840811,"data":"       | We can square both sides to eliminate radicals: [39^2 (74 s - 11)^2] * (148 s^2 -324 s +225) = [5^2 (370 s + 99)^2] * (148 s^2 -268 s +169).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114842162,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114843282,"data":"       | Simplify: 1521 (74 s - 11)^2 (148 s^2 -324 s +225) = 25 (370 s + 99)^2 (148 s^2 -268 s +169).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114844527,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114845625,"data":"       | Now we can solve for s.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114846744,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114848011,"data":"       | Let's compute with sympy rationally.assistantanalysis to=python codes=sp.symbols('s')\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114849315,"data":"       | eq = sp.Eq(1521*(74*s-11)**2*(148*s**2-324*s+225), 25*(370*s+99)**2*(148*s**2-268*s+169))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.114850601,"data":"       | solutions = sp.solve(eq, s)\n"}
