,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.115108435,"data":"       | Define Q = (x_Q, y_Q) on line AM, between A and M. Parameter t from A to M: Q = A + t*(M - A), where t in [0,1] (t=0 at A, t=1 at M). So coordinates: Q = (5 + t*(7-5), 12 + t*(0-12)) = (5 + 2t, 12 -12t) = (5+2t, 12(1 - t)). Equivalent.\n"}
