,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.115113426,"data":"       | Angle PBQ: angle between vectors BP and BQ at B. So compute angle between vectors P-B = P - B = P (since B at origin) and Q - B = Q. Similarly angle PCQ: angle between vectors C-P and C-Q at C.\n"}
