,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.115115964,"data":"       | We need equality of these angles. Equivalent to equality of cosines of the angles (since angles are between 0 and π). Since both angles likely acute? Let's check.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.115119715,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.115120851,"data":"       | Compute cos(angle PBQ) = (BP·BQ) / (|BP||BQ|). Similarly cos(angle PCQ) = ((P-C)·(Q-C)) / (|P-C||Q-C|). Equality of angles =\u003e equality of cosines. However there may be ambiguous sign if angle \u003e 90°, but we can check.\n"}
