,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3102.117067307,"data":"       | Thus displacement = (197/(74), - (6*197)/(74)). Simplify: 197/74 = reduce? gcd 197,74? 74=2*37, 197 is prime? 197 is prime (divisible by 197 only). So fraction stays 197/74. So coordinates of P: A + displacement = (5 + 197/74, 12 - 6*197/74). Compute: 5 = 5*74/74 = 370/74. So x-coordinate: (370 + 197)/74 = 567/74 = simplify? 567/74 not reducible (gcd 567,74= ? 74 prime factors 2*37; 567 divisible by 3 and 7? 567/3=189, 567/37? 37*15=555, remainder 12; not divisible. So fraction remains 567/74.\n"}
