,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.358275075,"data":"       | analysisWe got total 315 rectangles. But need to verify if each rectangle is counted exactly once. Since we considered s from 0..5, each rectangle's sides belong to families s and s+6 for some s. Indeed each rectangle will be counted exactly once because we only consider s in 0..5, not s+6.\n"}
