,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.358308381,"data":"       | We can also compute rectangles by enumerating all quadruples of points (intersection points) that form a rectangle with sides lying on chords. Another approach: generate all line segments (chords) and compute all rectangles formed by intersection of four chords. Let's implement a direct enumeration of all rectangles defined by four points (intersection points) and verify they correspond to our count.\n"}
