,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.358311412,"data":"       | We need to compute all intersection points of chords (including vertices). Then find all sets of four points forming a rectangle such that each side lies on a chord. But that's more complex.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.358312926,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.358314181,"data":"       | Alternatively, we can compute all rectangles as we did and verify that each rectangle's vertices are distinct and inside polygon.\n"}
