,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.359911348,"data":"       | Thus pattern: For even families (size m-1), there are three \"central\" pairs with common = m-1? Actually for m=6, m-1=5. Yes common=5. The rest 7 pairs have common = 3 (which is m-3? Since m=6, m-3=3). So common counts are either m-1 or m-3.\n"}
