,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.36114206,"data":"       | We'll implement point-in-convex-polygon test: For convex polygon with vertices in order, point is inside if cross product of edge vector and vector to point have same sign (non-negative). We'll use tolerance.\n"}
