,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.36511626,"data":"       | - Any chord connecting vertices i and j has step size k = min(|i-j|, 12-|i-j|). The chord's direction angle is (i+j)/2 * 30° + 90°, which yields 12 possible directions: multiples of 15°.\n"}
