,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365118878,"data":"       | - There are 6 directions that are multiples of 30° (even directions) and 6 directions that are odd multiples of 15° (odd directions). Even directions correspond to chords of even step sizes (2,4,6). Odd directions correspond to chords of odd step sizes (1,3,5).\n"}
