,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365691237,"data":"       | analysisThe enumeration may be heavy due to sympy symbolic solving each time. Let's try to speed up using numeric approximations. Since we just need to test inside polygon, we can use numeric coordinates (float) and tolerance. Use numpy.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365692751,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365693857,"data":"       | But we also need to ensure uniqueness; we can use approximate rounding.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365695065,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.36569621,"data":"       | Let's compute using numeric coordinates (float). Use vertices as floats from math cos and sin. Compute line coefficients as floats. Intersection via solving linear equations. Then test inside polygon using shapely? Not available. Use point-in-convex-polygon test: For convex polygon, a point is inside if it is always on same side of each edge (or using winding). We can compute using cross product signs.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365698,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365699139,"data":"       | Simplify: Use shapely? Not allowed. We'll implement point-in-polygon for convex polygon using barycentric method: For each edge (v_i, v_{i+1}), compute cross product (v_{i+1} - v_i) × (p - v_i). For a convex polygon oriented counterclockwise, all cross products should be \u003e=0 for interior (or \u003c=0). We'll compute orientation of polygon (should be ccw). Use tolerance.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365701275,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365702408,"data":"       | Let's implement enumeration with floats.assistantanalysis to=python codeimport math, itertools\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365705404,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365706482,"data":"       | n=12\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365707621,"data":"       | verts_f = [(math.cos(2*math.pi*i/n), math.sin(2*math.pi*i/n)) for i in range(n)]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365708897,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365709964,"data":"       | def line_coeff(p1,p2):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365711088,"data":"       |     # return (a,b,c) for line ax+by+c=0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365712244,"data":"       |     x1,y1 = p1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365713344,"data":"       |     x2,y2 = p2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365714453,"data":"       |     a = y1 - y2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365715532,"data":"       |     b = x2 - x1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.36571662,"data":"       |     c = x1*y2 - x2*y1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365717772,"data":"       |     return (a,b,c)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.36571887,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365719938,"data":"       | def intersect(line1,line2):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365721044,"data":"       |     a1,b1,c1 = line1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365722151,"data":"       |     a2,b2,c2 = line2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.36572327,"data":"       |     det = a1*b2 - a2*b1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365724387,"data":"       |     if abs(det) \u003c 1e-12:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365725512,"data":"       |         return None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365726634,"data":"       |     x = (b1*c2 - b2*c1)/det\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365727779,"data":"       |     y = (c1*a2 - c2*a1)/det\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365728894,"data":"       |     return (x,y)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365730024,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365731085,"data":"       | def point_in_convex_polygon(pt, poly):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.36573225,"data":"       |     # poly list of vertices ccw\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365733394,"data":"       |     x,y = pt\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365734476,"data":"       |     n = len(poly)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365735601,"data":"       |     # compute cross product sign for each edge\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365736734,"data":"       |     sign = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365738041,"data":"       |     for i in range(n):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365739214,"data":"       |         x1,y1 = poly[i]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365740341,"data":"       |         x2,y2 = poly[(i+1)%n]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365741462,"data":"       |         # edge vector\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.36574257,"data":"       |         ex,ey = x2-x1, y2-y1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365743706,"data":"       |         # vector from vertex to point\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365744882,"data":"       |         vx,vy = x - x1, y - y1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.36574602,"data":"       |         cross = ex*vy - ey*vx\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365747126,"data":"       |         # tolerance\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365748235,"data":"       |         if abs(cross) \u003c 1e-9:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365750861,"data":"       |             continue\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365752023,"data":"       |         cur_sign = cross \u003e 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365753194,"data":"       |         if sign is None:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365754317,"data":"       |             sign = cur_sign\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365755462,"data":"       |         elif sign != cur_sign:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365756594,"data":"       |             return False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.365757726,"data":"       |     return True\n"}
