,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.366557397,"data":"       | Let's compute counts for each pair to see distribution of rectangle sizes. We'll compute for each pair (0,6) the set of intervals lengths (i2-i1) and (j2-j1). Let's analyze.\n"}
