,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.366694971,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.36669604,"data":"       | Thus both families consist of chords of step 2,4,6. The arrangement forms a grid of lines that are symmetric.\n"}
