,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.366698495,"data":"       | Now for odd directions (1,7) etc., the chords include step 1 (sides), step 3, step 5? Let's check direction d=1: chords with i+j ≡ 1: pairs (0,1) side (step1), (2,11) step? diff 9 =\u003e step 3? Actually 2 to 11 diff 9 =\u003e step 3 (since min(9,3)=3). (3,10) diff 7 =\u003e step 5? Actually min(7,5)=5. (4,9) diff5 =\u003e step5? Actually diff5 =\u003e step5? Wait min(5,7)=5. (5,8) diff3 =\u003e step3. So steps 1,3,5.\n"}
