,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.366708292,"data":"       | But we got more rectangles for odd pairs (54) than even pairs (51). Actually odd pairs have more lines (6 each) but also more invalid combos; still produce more rectangles (54 vs 51). So more lines yields more possibilities.\n"}
