,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.367724517,"data":"       | We'll compute intersection using line segment intersection algorithm (including endpoints). Use orientation of triples.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.367725826,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.367726856,"data":"       | Let's implement.\n"}
