,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.369883271,"data":"       | Let's analyze orientation d even (N_d =5). For even d, chords correspond to step lengths 2,4,6 (i.e., even steps). There are 5 chords: 2 chords of step 2 (parallel pairs), 2 chords of step 4, and 1 diameter (step 6). Similarly, orientation d+6 also even with 5 chords.\n"}
