,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.369889659,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.369890755,"data":"       | Let's analyze combinatorially: For even orientation, chords are of three types: short chords (step 2), medium chords (step 4), and diameter (step 6). Let's label them as:\n"}
