,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3398.370250419,"data":"       | We can also provide a direct counting using geometry: For each rectangle, its sides are parallel to some pair of directions. There are 6 pairs of perpendicular directions (since 12 directions, each paired with opposite). Among these, 3 pairs involve even directions (i.e., chords of even step lengths) and 3 pairs involve odd directions. For each pair, we count rectangles.\n"}
